        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/3d1bef5a967ef9c59fcdb451c4074d0a.poster.avif?t=1787225895\" aria-label=\"Success_gif\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/3d1bef5a967ef9c59fcdb451c4074d0a.webm?t=1787225895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/3d1bef5a967ef9c59fcdb451c4074d0a.mp4?t=1787225895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WOULD YOU JUMP TO THE SKY… ON A POGO STICK?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;POGO UP ! &quot;, a vertical adventure where one man, one pogo stick, and a whole lot of poor decisions lead to the ultimate climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a surreal, floating world full of bizarre obstacles, strange structures, and precarious platforms — all standing between you and the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no map. No checkpoints. Just your pogo stick, physics, and your growing frustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall once? Back to the start. Fall again? Well, you're used to it now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your balance, aim your jumps, a bounce your way through a mysterious world suspended in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is he climbing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s at the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And seriously… why a pogo stick? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/785e8bd683018011f899821ef9205132.poster.avif?t=1787225895\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/785e8bd683018011f899821ef9205132.webm?t=1787225895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/785e8bd683018011f899821ef9205132.mp4?t=1787225895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based pogo jumping — easy to play, hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum &amp; timing are everything — balance is key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful soundtrack to contrast your internal screaming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No checkpoints, restart only </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features stage-based checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you move, the faster and higher you go — until you lose control.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/3d1bef5a967ef9c59fcdb451c4074d0a.poster.avif?t=1787225895\" aria-label=\"Success_gif\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/3d1bef5a967ef9c59fcdb451c4074d0a.webm?t=1787225895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/3d1bef5a967ef9c59fcdb451c4074d0a.mp4?t=1787225895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WOULD YOU JUMP TO THE SKY… ON A POGO STICK?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;POGO UP ! &quot;, a vertical adventure where one man, one pogo stick, and a whole lot of poor decisions lead to the ultimate climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a surreal, floating world full of bizarre obstacles, strange structures, and precarious platforms — all standing between you and the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no map. No checkpoints. Just your pogo stick, physics, and your growing frustration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall once? Back to the start. Fall again? Well, you're used to it now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your balance, aim your jumps, a bounce your way through a mysterious world suspended in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is he climbing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s at the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And seriously… why a pogo stick? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/785e8bd683018011f899821ef9205132.poster.avif?t=1787225895\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/785e8bd683018011f899821ef9205132.webm?t=1787225895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891990/extras/785e8bd683018011f899821ef9205132.mp4?t=1787225895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based pogo jumping — easy to play, hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum &amp; timing are everything — balance is key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful soundtrack to contrast your internal screaming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No checkpoints, restart only </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features stage-based checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you move, the faster and higher you go — until you lose control.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "All you have is a pogo stick. You must reach the top. There’s no reason. But go up anyway.",
